\f1\b\fs48 \cf0 VES Studio: Comprehensive Project Scope\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\fs36 \cf0 1. Project Overview\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\fs24 \cf0 VES Studio
\f0\b0  is a modern, scientific, open-source-first platform for 
\f1\b Vertical Electrical Sounding (VES)
\f0\b0  data processing, quality control, apparent-resistivity calculation, 1D subsurface inversion, visualization, geological/lithological interpretation, and reporting.\
The central idea is not simply to create a prettier version of existing VES software.\
It is to create an 
\f1\b end-to-end VES interpretation workspace
\f0\b0  where a user can take field data from:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 Raw measurements 
\f2 \uc0\u8594 
\f1  Processing 
\f2 \uc0\u8594 
\f1  QC 
\f2 \uc0\u8594 
\f1  Apparent resistivity 
\f2 \uc0\u8594 
\f1  Curve analysis 
\f2 \uc0\u8594 
\f1  1D inversion 
\f2 \uc0\u8594 
\f1  Layer model 
\f2 \uc0\u8594 
\f1  Interpretation 
\f2 \uc0\u8594 
\f1  Visualization 
\f2 \uc0\u8594 
\f1  Report
\f0\b0 \
without needing several disconnected tools for the core workflow.\
The product should be scientifically rigorous underneath while being significantly easier to understand and operate.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa321\partightenfactor0

