\f1\b\fs48 \cf0 \strokec2 79. Final Product Definition\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 The core product can be summarized as:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 VES Studio is a modern, open-source-first platform for processing and interpreting Vertical Electrical Sounding data. It combines validated electrode-array calculations, automated data quality control, apparent-resistivity analysis, 1D inversion, subsurface visualization, geological interpretation, and reporting into one reproducible workflow. V1 establishes the scientifically validated single-station workflow, V2 expands the system into spatial multi-station interpretation, and V3 adds an AI-assisted interface that operates on top of deterministic scientific computations.
\f0\b0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa321\partightenfactor0

